{"projectInfo":{"name":"IPv6 BGP与BFD联动配置","path":"ipv6_bgp_bfd","visibility":2,"categoryId":40,"introduction":"在AS 200内使用OSPFv3作为IGP协议，实现AS内的互通。Router A与Router C之间建立两条IBGP连接。当Router A与Router C之间的两条路径均连通时，Router C与1200::0/64之间的报文使用Router A\u003c－\u003eRouter B\u003c－\u003eRouter C这条路径转发；当Router A\u003c－\u003eRouter B\u003c－\u003eRouter C这条路径发生故障时，BFD能够快速检测并通告IPv6 BGP协议，使得Router A\u003c－\u003eRouter D\u003c－\u003eRouter C这条路径能够迅速生效。","label":["BGP"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"AS-300","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS-300.cfg"},{"resourceName":"AS-100","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\AS-100.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Router-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Router-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Router-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Router-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Router-C","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Router-C.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Router-D","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Router-D.cfg"}]}